# NOTE: build context lives at repo root (we use `-f packages/core/Dockerfile .`),
# so Docker actually applies the .dockerignore at the repo root, not this file.
# This file is kept for clarity / fallback if anyone ever runs `docker build packages/core`.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
*.log
.env*
tests
**/tests
__tests__
**/__tests__
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
.turbo
.cache
.vite
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
*.tsbuildinfo
